OL,3,A'It's literally a lottery': Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027 ticket sale begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of music lovers are "in two
OL,7,Fbar hell" as they try to secure their
OL,8,Fplace at Glastonbury 2027
OL,10,FBuyers can secure up to six tickets -
OL,11,Fthe first batch sold out in less than
OL,12,F30 minutes on Thursday
OL,14,FFrom forming syndicates to casting
OL,15,Fspells to win favour with the festival
OL,16,Fgods, we're hearing about your tips and
OL,17,Ftricks to battle the queue
OL,19,FOrganisers have warned buyers not to
OL,20,Fuse multiple tabs or refresh the page
OL,21,Fwhile they try to get through the queue
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
