OL,3,A'It's literally a lottery': Glastonbury
OL,4,A2027 ticket sale begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new queuing system was introduced
OL,7,Fthis year, which means each registered
OL,8,Fattendee only gets one place in the
OL,9,Fline - one festival veteran says "it's
OL,10,Fliterally a lottery"
OL,12,FTickets to Britain's biggest music
OL,13,Ffestival now cost more than #400
OL,14,F($528). In 1970, the event cost #1 and
OL,15,Fincluded a free pint of milk from
OL,16,FWorthy Farm
